diff --git a/CLAUDE_RULES.md b/CLAUDE_RULES.md
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..d4a926f
--- /dev/null
+++ b/CLAUDE_RULES.md
@@ -0,0 +1,52 @@
+# Claude Code Rules — AskOxy.ai
+
+## CRITICAL — Always follow these rules
+
+## DATABASE RULES
+- NEVER use live/production database
+- ONLY use these test databases:
+  - Testcartdb
+  - Testordersdb
+  - Testoxyai
+  - Testproductdb
+  - Testreferencedb
+  - Testuserdb
+- Wait for approval before any INSERT/UPDATE/DELETE
+
+## COMMUNICATION RULES
+- NEVER send real OTP SMS to users
+- NEVER send real emails to users
+- NEVER send real WhatsApp messages
+- Log all to console only in test mode
+- OTP bypass value: 1234
+- Hidden test login available
+
+## TEST MODE PROPERTIES
+- test.mode=true
+- otp.bypass.enabled=true
+- otp.bypass.value=1234
+- test.login.enabled=true
+- email.sending.enabled=false
+- sms.sending.enabled=false
+- whatsapp.sending.enabled=false
+
+## AI LAYER RULES
+- All AI queries READ ONLY
+- @Transactional(readOnly = true) always
+- No writes from AI layer ever
+
+## SECURITY RULES
+- No live credentials in any commit
+- No production passwords in code
+- No API keys committed to git
+
+## BRANCH RULES
+- Never push to main/master directly
+- Work on feature branches only
+- Always show diff before committing
+
+## BEFORE EVERY SESSION
+- Read this file first
+- Confirm test DB configured
+- Confirm test mode enabled
+- Show current branch
-- 
