 URLs for private docs
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- Add askoxyImgUrl() helper in Config.tsx — rewrites askoxy S3 URLs to
  CloudFront (d15sy6qj2uhi5q.cloudfront.net) after bucket was made private
- Apply CloudFront rewrite across Home, categories, itemsdisplay, Cart,
  AistoreCreation, AllAistore, agentApi for all product images
- Add utils/presignedUrl.ts — fetches expiring pre-signed URLs from backend
  for sensitive documents (resumes, KYC, study-abroad docs)
- Update FreelancerList, AppliedJobs, StudyAbroad/Documents to use
  pre-signed URLs on download/view (backend endpoint: GET /user-service/presigned-url)
- Fix setupProxy.js: use meta.oxyloans.com domain instead of dead IP
- Fix HiddenLogin.tsx: route through /local-api proxy in development

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>
